"konunun altında olumlu, olumsuz ve soru biçiminde örnek cümleler bulacaksın "
"— hepsi Türkçe karşılığıyla birlikte."
msgstr ""
"From tenses to conditionals, from modal verbs to the passive voice, we've "
"gathered the core grammar of English with clear explanations. Under each "
"topic you'll find positive, negative and question examples — all with "
"translations."

#: templates/seo/grammar_index.html:52
