"olan her gün tekrar etmektir."
msgstr ""
"Skim a list: if you know roughly %%80 of the words, move up a level. If more "
"than half are unfamiliar, stay one level below. A target of 20–30 new words "
"a day is sustainable for most people — what matters is reviewing every day."

